classDiagram
    class Task {
        +str description
        +str time
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str frequency
        +date due_date
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() None
        +next_occurrence() Task
    }
    note for Task "Compared by identity (eq=False). next_occurrence() returns None for one-time tasks."

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +remove_task(task) None
        +get_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +get_pet(name) Pet
        +get_all_tasks() list
    }
    note for Owner "get_pet() returns None if no match. get_all_tasks() returns (Pet, Task) pairs."

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +get_todays_schedule() list
        +sort_by_time(tasks) list
        +filter_tasks(pet_name, completed) list
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
        +mark_task_complete(pet, task) None
    }
    note for Scheduler "Schedule methods work on (Pet, Task) pairs. Sorting is by due date, then time."

    Owner "1" *-- "many" Pet : has
    Pet "1" *-- "many" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : uses
    Scheduler ..> Pet : adds next occurrence to
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts, filters, flags conflicts
    Task ..> Task : creates next occurrence
